<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-27T15:24:55.091Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:24:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Union Home Secretary Govind Mohan met top security officials in Jammu to review the situation and discuss anti-infiltration measures, while security forces in Manipur buried seven Kuki civilians killed by militants after two months and shifted the BSF Raising Day parade from Manipur to Delhi over security concerns. In the border region, China and India held fresh talks as both sides increased military readiness before winter. A bear attack injured five people in Udhampur and a leopard injured a seven-year-old boy in Kupwara shortly after a fatal attack in the same district. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3376066/china-and-india-hold-fresh-border-talks-both-boost-military-readiness-winter&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPQlpCd21UckM3RE5IWUZZNXpnUXJJRHFvX3NKMnIyQWtGbnBfbVZ4Sm1iNENfR3hnTjBJVlpvRDBRYXFyWVNhdk9NQTY0RWJSdEZNVDltNFJfR1pnQWVJeTNta2VPdFM4alVMOTM0RndiLURBaUlQYzdBM3BwMGRPUjdrOEZSUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizwFBVV95cUxPUzN4VVdkSm1nbFFudU5ueThUeVVFOE1LbDBHR1ZXdWVkUVF2ZWtaa09ybWlMcjBMbTQ4NWpCWGMtSGlGSXdPRG15dm9kaXluOXJSNEdLdnVhOTRUb2M5dzU5MURhTmpaYzlXVU5XcG1NYUo3clA0QUdUSjhCLTZaeFdWUGxlQUhubGtMak43a2pYbVpEd1ZQWWdvWW5JR1lyMUR5ZkI4QkFKQzk5d3BDREZWbFByY0g5NW5mY0prYk0yR2daVUlCaE5IR0tZZm_SAdQBQVVfeXFMT2F2TUhiRV82MTNuLXRiVTN2bXlhemNna1VOTGdGdWdnRVJNYVFMRnEtMUZ5UVg1WFFwd2JVUHBmd2czMWtDb1k5VmE3cjJoX3U2NnloNVdIck5kUV9mT2RwQ2VFTXRWaV